        "output": "=== DIRECT CASH RECEIPTS AGING & DECAY CURVE PROJECTION ===\nOpening Total Accounts Receivable: $12,000,000.00\nTotal 13-Week New Contract Billings: $10,400,000.00\nTotal 13-Week Cash Receipts Projected: $16,698,400.00\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\nWeek     | Weekly Projected Receipts    | Cumulative Receipts\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\nWeek 01  | $            1,775,000.00 | $        1,775,000.00\nWeek 02  | $            2,045,000.00 | $        3,820,000.00\nWeek 03  | $            2,045,000.00 | $        5,865,000.00\nWeek 04  | $            1,765,000.00 | $        7,630,000.00\nWeek 05  | $            1,628,000.00 | $        9,258,000.00\nWeek 06  | $            1,938,400.00 | $       11,196,400.00\nWeek 07  | $              846,000.00 | $       12,042,400.00\nWeek 08  | $              776,000.00 | $       12,818,400.00\nWeek 09  | $              776,000.00 | $       13,594,400.00\nWeek 10  | $              776,000.00 | $       14,370,400.00\nWeek 11  | $              776,000.00 | $       15,146,400.00\nWeek 12  | $              776,000.00 | $       15,922,400.00\nWeek 13  | $              776,000.00 | $       16,698,400.00\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\nReceipts Analysis: High-velocity collection in Weeks 1-4 driven by past-due AR recovery,\ntransitioning to steady-state collections from newly billed cohorts from Week 5 onward.\n"
