        "output": "=== REGULATORY FILING WEB SCRAPING & HTML PARSING ENGINE ===\nSource Portal: SEC_EDGAR_Filing_Portal | Extraction Method: Semantic CSS Selector Parsing\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSEC 10-Q Financial Line Item     | Q3 2026 ($M)   | Q2 2026 ($M)   | QoQ Growth\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCloud Enterprise Revenue         | $    1,450.50 | $    1,280.00 |    +13.32%\nCost of Cloud Operations         | $     -480.20 | $     -450.00 |     -6.71%\nGross Operational Profit         | $      970.30 | $      830.00 |    +16.90%\nResearch & Development           | $     -285.00 | $     -260.00 |     -9.62%\nOperating Income (EBIT)          | $      685.30 | $      570.00 |    +20.23%\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nExtraction Status: 5 GAAP line items parsed with zero accounting parenthetical errors."
